{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"slavery-and-women","title":"奴隶制与妇女","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/slavery-and-women","wordCount":1869,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"plato-versus-aristotle","title":"柏拉图与亚里士多德之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/plato-versus-aristotle","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视围绕亚里士多德的争议。&quot;奴隶制与妇女&quot;——亚里士多德曾为奴隶制辩护、对妇女持有偏见，这些以今天眼光看是错误的看法，反映了其时代的局限，应予批判。&quot;柏拉图与亚里士多德之争&quot;——则探讨这对师徒所代表的两种伟大哲学传统（理想主义与现实主义）的对峙与互补。本章以审慎而全面的态度辨析这些争议。</p>\n"}